  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn></math> balls each of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> moving with speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math> simultaneously strike a wall normally and reflected back with same speed, in time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>. The total force exerted by the balls on the wall is",
